{"3935230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bodybuilder Simulator", "steam_appid": 3935230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💪 <strong>Bodybuilder Simulator – From Skinny to Supreme!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodybuilder Simulator is a fun bodybuilding simulation game where you explore gyms and fitness. Start as a skinny character, lift weights, build muscle, get stronger, and become a legend!</p></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏋️‍♂️ <strong>Lift Weights &amp; Get Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with dumbbells, barbells, and machines. The more weight you lift, the more muscle you gain, bringing you closer to bodybuilding glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Work &amp; Earn Money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry watermelons, deliver packages, stack boxes! Take on different jobs to fund your fitness career and invest in training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>Open Your Own Gym</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your dream gym into reality! Open your fitness center, place machines, keep customers happy, and grow your wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💊 <strong>Use Supplements &amp; Grow Faster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost progress with protein powder, creatine, BCAAs, and ZMA. With the right supplements, you’ll reach max muscle mass faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Join Competitions &amp; Become a Champion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once built enough, enter bodybuilding contests, earn ranks, and win big prizes. Each win brings you closer to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Try Your Luck at the Casino</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play blackjack, coin toss, and horse racing. But beware—you could double your money or lose it all!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💪 <strong>Bodybuilder Simulator – From Skinny to Supreme!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bodybuilder Simulator is a fun bodybuilding simulation game where you explore gyms and fitness. Start as a skinny character, lift weights, build muscle, get stronger, and become a legend!</p></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏋️‍♂️ <strong>Lift Weights &amp; Get Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train with dumbbells, barbells, and machines. The more weight you lift, the more muscle you gain, bringing you closer to bodybuilding glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/63647c16951fcd11e30b25447e1ab3b8.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 <strong>Work &amp; Earn Money</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry watermelons, deliver packages, stack boxes! Take on different jobs to fund your fitness career and invest in training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/2d5031dfc959ca8b6d2c8b354ba3643c.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏢 <strong>Open Your Own Gym</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your dream gym into reality! Open your fitness center, place machines, keep customers happy, and grow your wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.poster.avif?t=1779538637\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.webm?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935230/extras/e4f578557caa43eea0a5dc58f9cd9a38.mp4?t=1779538637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💊 <strong>Use Supplements &amp; Grow Faster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost progress with protein powder, creatine, BCAAs, and ZMA. With the right supplements, you’ll reach max muscle mass faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 <strong>Join Competitions &amp; Become a Champion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once built enough, enter bodybuilding contests, earn ranks, and win big prizes. Each win brings you closer to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 <strong>Try Your Luck at the Casino</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play blackjack, coin toss, and horse racing. But beware—you could double your money or lose it all!</p>", "short_description": "Bodybuilder Simulator is a simulation game where you try to build muscle and earn money. You can train using various machines in the gym. Outside the gym, you can explore places like the market, hospital, and casino. You can also open and manage your own gym to multiply your earnings.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Ch